 "note": "args = [units as [{line, rows, hidden}] in document order, options {mode, countFolded, cursorRow, cursorLine}]; expected = the gutter text of each display row, one array of strings for each unit. cursorRow is counted in rows from the start of the first unit, negative above it.",
